Dockerfile


Docker file , build image , container & port combination 

Key Concepts
* Dockerfile: The source script or blueprint containing instructions.
* Docker Image: The lightweight, standalone, and executable package built from a Dockerfile. Images are immutable once created.
* Docker Container: A running instance of a Docker image. Containers are the isolated runtime environments where your application actually executes. 



Common Dockerfile Instructions
Instructions in a Dockerfile are typically written in uppercase by convention and are executed in order. 
* FROM: Required as the first instruction, it sets the base image from which you are building (e.g., FROM ubuntu or FROM python:3.9).
* RUN: Executes commands in a new layer on top of the current image and commits the results. Used for installing packages, compiling code, etc., during the build process.
* COPY: Copies files/folders from the host machine's source path to the destination path inside the image.
* ADD: Similar to COPY, but can also handle remote URLs and automatically extract compressed archives (like .tar.gz).
* WORKDIR: Sets the working directory for any subsequent RUN, CMD, ENTRYPOINT, COPY, or ADD instructions.
* CMD: Provides default commands and arguments for executing the application inside the container. These can be overridden when the container is run.
* ENTRYPOINT: Configures the container to run as an executable. Unlike CMD, this command is not easily overridden at runtime.
* EXPOSE: Informs Docker that the container will listen on the specified network ports at runtime. This is a metadata instruction and doesn't actually publish the port. 


WORKDIR : နောက်လာမယ့် RUN, CMD, COPY, ADD အတွက် base path ဖြစ်သွားတယ်
WORKDIR /app = cd /app. လုပ်ထားသလိုပဲ

CMD ["python3", "app.py"]
Container run လိုက်တဲ့အချိန် default command သတ်မှတ်တာ
CMD က override လုပ်လို့ရ
docker run မှာ command ထပ်ရေးရင် CMD ပျောက်သွားမယ်
COMMAND တူမှ override ဖြစ်မှာလား၊ မတူရင်ရော override ဖြစ်လား။ ?? 



ENTRYPOINT
 Container ရဲ့ အဓိက executable ကို သတ်မှတ်တာ
CMD နဲ့မတူတာက  ENTRYPOINT ကို override လုပ်ရခက်တယ်  CMD ကို ENTRYPOINT ရဲ့ argument အဖြစ်သုံးနိုင်တယ်

ENTRYPOINT ["python3", "app.py"]



